ove joist deck drainage system; Trex Protect joist, beam and rim tape, a self-adhesive butyl tape that protects wooden deck framing/substructure elements; Trex RainEscape Soffit Light, a plug-and-play LED Soffit light that is installed in the under-deck ceiling of a two-story deck; Trex Seal Ledger Flashing Tape, butyl flashing tape with an aluminum liner; Trex Pergola, Pergolas made from low maintenance aluminum  reinforced cellular PVC; Trex Lattice outdoor boards; Trex Cornhole boards; Trex Blade, a specialty saw blade for wood-alternative composite decking; Trex SpiralStairs; and Trex Outdoor Kitchen cabinetry. The company sells its products through wholesale distributors, retail lumber dealers, and Home Depot and Lowe's stores. Trex Company, Inc. was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Winchester, Virginia.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"2400","sic_desc":"Lumber & Wood Products (No Furniture)","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","mcap":4437248000,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"WINCHESTER, VA","exchange":"XNYS","fy_end":"1231","cik":1069878,"state_inc":"DE","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-08"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-03","q":[{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":303836000.0,"rev_yoy":61.2,"eps":0.6,"eps_yoy":361.5,"ni":65266000.0,"ni_yoy":352.5,"nm":21.5,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-31","rev":195745000.0,"rev_yoy":1.9,"eps":0.19,"eps_yoy":90.0,"ni":20686000.0,"ni_yoy":105.3,"nm":10.6,"derived":["eps","rev","ni"],"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-31","rev":373635000.0,"rev_yoy":56.5,"eps":0.82,"eps_yoy":115.8,"ni":89070000.0,"ni_yoy":116.6,"nm":23.8,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-30","rev":376470000.0,"rev_yoy":5.6,"eps":0.8,"eps_yoy":12.7,"ni":86998000.0,"ni_yoy":12.9,"nm":23.1,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"